      "decision_index": 162,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Traded Kami of Ancient Law in combat against Lightning Visionary, losing the ability to destroy the opponent's Crawling Sensation, which is generating Insect tokens and milling every turn. Crawling Sensation provides significant ongoing value that Kami could cleanly answer.",
