      "decision_index": 169,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Missed lethal. Opponent is at 10 life with all creatures tapped and no mana available. Attacking with Turntimber Basilisk (2) + Canopy Baloth (6) + Kami of Ancient Law (2) = 10 damage, which is exactly lethal. Instead, only attacked for 8, leaving opponent alive at 2 life.",
