      "decision_index": 184,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Failed to respond to Divine Verdict targeting the 6/5 Canopy Baloth by casting Valorous Stance (indestructible mode). The Baloth dealing 6 combat damage plus Turntimber Basilisk's 2 would have put the opponent to 2 life. Instead, the Baloth dies and only 2 damage gets through, leaving the opponent at 8 life. This is a near-lethal swing that was missed.",
      "action_taken": "Timed out (no response) while the game was prompting for mana to potentially cast Valorous Stance in response to Divine Verdict, allowing Divine Verdict to resolve and destroy Canopy Baloth.",
