    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Casting Valorous Stance during combat when the Turntimber Basilisk is attacking unblocked and the opponent has zero untapped mana (cannot cast any tricks). The indestructible mode provides no benefit since nothing threatens the creature, and there are no opposing creatures with toughness 4+ for the destroy mode. This wastes a premium protection/removal spell for no value.",
