      "description": "Casting Valorous Stance in postcombat main when no opponent creature has toughness 4 or greater (Nantuko Cultivator is only 3/3). The only usable mode is giving indestructible to own creature, which accomplishes nothing with combat over and no threats on the stack. This wastes a valuable reactive spell that could protect creatures in future combats. Meanwhile, Kami of Ancient Law could have been sacrificed to destroy Crawling Sensation, which is generating incremental value every turn (milling + creating insect tokens).",
